{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50205","headline":"秋晴过李三山池（斯二七一七下同） · 马吉甫","name":"秋晴过李三山池（斯二七一七下同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山游[□]未狎，朝隐遂爲羣。\n地僻烟霞异，心闲出处分。\n褰开弄晴景，披拂喜朝闻，（「闻」，蒋当作「雰」。\n）野兴浮黄菊，林栖卧白云。\n窥临苔壁古，歌啸竹亭曛。\n回想幽岩路。\n知予复解纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马吉甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}